               END-SEARCH.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       RECONCILE-REG-NUMBER-0135.
               UNSTRING WS-KEY-CHAR DELIMITED BY '/'
                             INTO WS-KEY-CUSTOMER
                                  WS-KEY-POLICY
               END-UNSTRING.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       RESOLVE-PREMIUM-0136.
               MOVE SPACES TO WS-KEY-CHAR.
